  "prefLabel": "Ins 2704.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 2704.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide for the regulation and registration of pharmacy benefits managers (PBMs) and to set forth rules which the commissioner deems necessary to carry out the provisions of RSA 402-N.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Ins 2704) #13059, eff 6-29-20",
